  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien tshia-koo song-dance in the rustic street-theatre banter style, brisk 2/4. A coconut-shell fiddle and a large two-string fiddle playing the tune in unison; a moon lute strummed in quick downstrokes; a bamboo flute countermelody; four bamboo clappers and a small hand gong carrying the rhythm over a light upright bass. Lively and close, dry, the clappers and the two voices forward. A comic male voice and a bright female head voice trading short rhymed lines in quick syllabic delivery, laughter in their voices, joining together on the chorus. 120 BPM, A major. Cheeky haggling that both sides enjoy. No drum kit, no electric guitar, no synth, no slow nanguan chamber singing, no autotune.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n虱目魚肚 透早鮮\n一斤兩百 好價錢\n煎落鼎底 芳上天\n包你食甲 喙甜甜\n\n[Verse]\n頭家喙甜 真趣味\n兩百敢是 金的魚\n魚肚薄甲 透光去\n一斤百五 才合理\n\n[Chorus]\n一百五!一百八!\n一百五!一百八!\n吵甲冰角 攏欲溶\n虱目魚 目睭金金看\n\n[Verse]\n一百七十 莫閣鬧\n閣送你 一粒魚頭\n魚頭留予 你的狗\n百六現金 我先交\n\n[Chorus]\n一百六!一百七!\n一百六!一百七!\n吵甲隔壁菜攤 攏來聽\n虱目魚 目睭金金看\n\n[Bridge]\n好啦好啦 百六好\n魚頭照送 莫囉嗦\n後擺你若 閣殺價\n刀仔予你 家己剖\n\n[Chorus]\n一百六!成交!\n一百六!成交!\n冰角溶甲 規塗跤\n虱目魚 嘛喘一口氣\n\n[Outro]\n明仔透早 我閣來\n好 我先共刀 磨予利",
